      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `4263758bfcf603ea3d67dfd3f3786d4eedeae0c5a62c82f408e06eb2cd26fff3--4.-victims-of-crime-indigenous-status-selected-states-and-territories.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2017\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 8 of 8\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | d1561ed62b189f4190ab801afba79160dbc6bfb0e93e7521898524fbcfbce24d | missing |\n| \"Table 16\" | d2c569cd62c008346678f81fc05c9d5495b1998c3353390aba181a21ab111f13 | missing |\n| \"Table 17\" | 68d85d1366681fe24c868b1853f3788f5c39cbe45e6abf0b4c0998398dd1b037 | missing |\n| \"Table 18\" | b95c654a77995897ad7ff3dabfe67516bbcd60b7281fdc172308b70547f62159 | missing |\n| \"Table 19\" | ff1c48c20f4343960b37c19614ff57c584709b05b1529651a9e6b18fd6165231 | missing |\n| \"Table 20\" | 4896f4274cbbfa1e11e93bbdf56659d9a35c19686c2bed17aa932209bd76993e | missing |\n| \"Table 21\" | f275a17e4414f786557d1d8a1f6974664919cfdd10c7bad0aea4d1babf2d119c | missing |\n| \"Explanatory Notes\" | dee6dba593dabd03c5346020f481cfb8e17f0e37c18a2854a9a316b8188789f5 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
